### send json
POST http://localhost:8081/json/producer/produce
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "color": "black",
  "name": "Barcik",
  "age": 1
}

### send string
GET http://localhost:8081/producer/produce/string?message=cat in Poland7

### show list of all sended jsons
GET http://localhost:8081/consumer/jsons

### show list of all sended strings
GET http://localhost:8081/consumer/